1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Add a host: enter an address and login; key and group are optional.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Search saved hosts and filter by group; return to all hosts when needed.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Browse saved commands. This demo does not run them.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Edit options and review the delete confirmation; this demo declines it.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:31,000
CLI: save a named command, then open its interactive manager.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
CLI commands and MCP options, including the opt-in remote command flag.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:54,640
MCP over stdio: inspect default tools. No SSH session is opened.
